# SNOBOL4 (scrip-snobol4) program 3, the corpus Tower of Hanoi (packages/snobol4/snoflake_suite, Griswold 1971) as a whole program in three cells: HANOI recurses twice per call, SOLVE loops by calling it for a number of discs and keeps the count, a DATA record MOVE is made for every move into a TABLE, and the driver prints the count and the last record. developer_14 2026-11-22. EXPECTED = what a person expects of SNOBOL4 and the step law of skill debugger section 2; the person's view of a step out of a routine is a stop back in its caller where the call is.
